      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BETTERTHANFEDERER (3) kicked off in Queensland with back-to-back wins here then had a slow post-race recovery when midfield as favourite last time. Has placed at the trials since. Draws well and can get back on track. STARZZZ DESTINY (10) disappointed as favourite last start but was going well with a string of top-four results prior. Draws out a little on the second line so may need luck at some point but if it comes his way he is capable of running a much better race. SPUNKYS GOTSECRETS (1) had a tough barrier last week so forgive that result. Won in NSW the last time he started on the front line and should enjoy a soft run from the inside draw. FOXFIRE EASTON NZ (5) may be worth including off a string of good efforts including a Redcliffe win from a 30m handicap two back.",
